sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Router as OpenShift Router<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Gateway as data-science-gateway<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS (service-ca)
    participant Envoy as EnvoyFilter<br/>ext_authz + Lua
    participant AuthProxy as kube-auth-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant AppSvc as Application Service<br/>HTTP/HTTPS

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client,AppSvc: Flow 1: Client Request Through Gateway to Application
        Client->>Router: HTTPS/443 (TLS 1.2+)<br/>No auth required
        Router->>Gateway: HTTPS/8443 (TLS service-ca)
        Gateway->>Envoy: ext_authz check (internal)
        Envoy->>AuthProxy: HTTPS/8443 (TLS service-ca)<br/>OAuth2/OIDC validation
        AuthProxy-->>Envoy: Auth result + token
        Envoy->>AppSvc: HTTP/HTTPS (varies)<br/>Bearer token (forwarded)
        AppSvc-->>Envoy: Response
        Envoy-->>Gateway: Response
        Gateway-->>Router: Response
        Router-->>Client: HTTPS Response
    end

    participant DSCCtrl as DSC Controller
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant CompCtrl as Component Controller
    participant Kustomize as Kustomize Manifests

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over DSCCtrl,K8sAPI: Flow 2: Component Provisioning via DAG
        DSCCtrl->>K8sAPI: Watch DataScienceCluster CR<br/>ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>DSCCtrl: DSC spec (component states)
        DSCCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Component CR<br/>(DAG runlevel ordering)
        K8sAPI-->>CompCtrl: Component CR event
        CompCtrl->>Kustomize: Render manifests
        Kustomize-->>CompCtrl: Rendered resources
        CompCtrl->>K8sAPI: Server-side Apply<br/>ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>CompCtrl: Apply result
        CompCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update Component status
    end

    participant AppPods as Application Pods
    participant OTelCol as OpenTelemetry Collector<br/>4317/TCP gRPC TLS<br/>4318/TCP HTTP
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>9090/TCP HTTP
    participant Tempo as Tempo<br/>4317/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant Perses as Perses

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over AppPods,Perses: Flow 3: Monitoring Telemetry Collection
        AppPods->>OTelCol: OTLP gRPC/4317 or HTTP/4318<br/>TLS (internal)
        OTelCol->>Prometheus: Remote write HTTP/9090<br/>(internal, no auth)
        OTelCol->>Tempo: OTLP gRPC/4317<br/>TLS (internal)
        Perses->>Prometheus: Query HTTP/9090<br/>(internal, no auth)
    end
